      "action": "HANDLE_OBJECTION",
      "message": "Fair concern—900 sqft isn’t a large unit. It’s a 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom layout, and the project materials describe all three bedrooms as able to fit a queen bed, with relatively little space taken up by corridors. Whether it feels comfortable really depends on your family’s needs. How many people would be staying there?",
