    {
      "turn": 1,
      "speaker": "customer",
      "message": "Four of us—me, my spouse and two kids. Queen beds fitting is good to know, but I’m also wondering whether there’s enough space to move around and fit our dining table and sofa without everything feeling squeezed.",
      "appointment_state": "NO_VIEWING_INTENT",
