    {
      "turn": 2,
      "speaker": "agent",
      "action": "HANDLE_OBJECTION",
      "message": "That’s a fair thing to check for a family of four. The living, dining and kitchen area is about 404.7 sq ft combined—not living space alone. The layout is described as having little wasted corridor, but whether your sofa and dining table leave enough room to move depends on their size. Do you usually use a 4- or 6-seater dining table?",
      "assessment": {
        "appointment_readiness": "NOT_READY",
        "handoff_state": "NO_HANDOFF",
        "handoff_reason": null
      }
    },
    {
      "turn": 2,
      "speaker": "customer",
      "message": "Usually a 4-seater. Our current place feels more open, so I’m trying to picture whether the sofa and table would leave enough room to move around in this layout.",
