    {
      "turn": 3,
      "speaker": "agent",
      "action": "HANDLE_OBJECTION",
      "message": "That makes sense—if your current place feels more open, it’s worth checking the furniture fit rather than assuming it’ll feel the same. With a 4-seater, the sofa’s size and placement will make a big difference to the walking space. Roughly how long is your sofa?",
